AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0000807> "MP:0000807")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0000807> "The synonym abnormal hippocampal formation is a frequently used synonym in the literature for the hippocampus. It is unfortunate that it implies a developmental process. There is also a lack of consensus relating to terms describing the hippocampus and/or the adjacent cerebral cortex with the term hippocampus sometimes referring to the hippocampal formation (or region) and sometimes only to the Ammon gyrus (Ammon's horn). In this ontology, we have used hippocampus to mean the entire formation (region).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0000807> "abnormal hippocampus morphology")
