# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0001492> (abnormal pilomotor reflex)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3691-0324>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "MESH:F02.830.702.607") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0001492> "anomaly in the involuntary bristling of hairs that occurs when an organism is cold or experiences strong emotions such as fear or awe")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0001492> "abnormal piloerection response")
