AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0002080> "Note that the name of this term has previously been embryonic lethality. In many species, the terms prenatal lethality and embryonic lethality are used interchangeably. However, this is not technically correct and we have modified this ontology to define the prenatal period to include the embryonic stages distinctly from the fetal stages. The names embryonic lethality and embryonic death have been retained as a narrow synonyms to aid in searching for those species that may use these terms as synonyms.")
