AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0002243> "MP:0002243")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0002243> "This organ is believed to function in sensing pheromones. While the structure has been thought to be absent from higher primate adults, some data suggests that a form may be present in adult humans.")
