# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0003844> (abnormal squamoparietal suture morphology)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:0803606559") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://anatomyzone.com/anatomy-feed/squamous-suture/") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0003844> "any structural anomaly of the dense, fibrous connective tissue joint between the squamous part of the temporal bone and the inferior aspect of the parietal bone; posteriorly, the squamous suture becomes the parietomastoid suture where the mastoid process articulates with the parietal bone; anteriorly, the squamous suture extends towards the pterion")
