# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0010000> (abnormal copula pyramidis morphology)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://braininfo.rprc.washington.edu/centraldirectory.aspx?ID=1894>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/452954/>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/7541173/>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/7978337/>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0010000> "any structural anomaly of a part of the cerebellar hemisphere in rodents that corresponds laterally to the pyramis of the vermis of the cerebellum; it is regarded as the homolog of the 'lateral belly' of the the biventer lobule of the human")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0010000> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3691-0324>)
