AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0010116> "Note that the term \"urogenital sinus\" may refer to the primitive urogenital sinus present as a transient developmental structure in most mammals or it may refer to a condition in which an unseptated cloaca persists in animals longer than normal.")
