AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0012126> "abnormal placenta haemotrichorial barrier")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0012126> "abnormal placenta haemotrichorial layer")
