AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0012267> "The red nucleus comprises a caudal magnocellular and a rostral parvocellular part. The red nucleus and substantia nigra are subcortical centers of the extrapyramidal motor system. In vertebrates without a significant corticospinal tract, gait is mainly controlled by the red nucleus.")
