# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0014726> (abnormal cardiomyocyte maturation)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32015528") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32271675") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:36502296") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0014726> "any anomaly in the developmental process where changes in cardiomyocyte cell structure, metabolism, function, and gene expression convert fetal cardiomyocytes to adult cardiomyocytes")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000233> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0014726> <https://github.com/mgijax/mammalian-phenotype-ontology/issues/4161>)
