# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030143> (facial muscle spasm)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "HP:0011468") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.healthgrades.com/symptoms/facial-spasms") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030143> "sudden, repetitive, nonrhythmic motor movements (spasms) involving the muscles of the face; common types of facial spasms include rapid, repetitive squinting or blinking, grimacing, mouth twitching, and nose twitching")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030143> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723>)
