# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030307> (abnormal anterior cranial fossa)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anterior_cranial_fossa") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030307> "any structural anomaly of the depression in the floor of the cranial base which houses the projecting frontal lobes of the brain; it is formed by the orbital plates of the frontal, the cribriform plate of the ethmoid, and the small wings and front part of the body of the sphenoid; it is limited behind by the posterior borders of the small wings of the sphenoid and by the anterior margin of the chiasmatic groove; the lesser wings of the sphenoid separate the anterior and middle fossae")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030307> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030307> "2017-10-23T09:40:21Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
