# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030320> (abnormal temporal bone tympanic part morphology)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tympanic_part_of_the_temporal_bone") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://radiopaedia.org/articles/tympanic-part-of-temporal-bone") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030320> "any structural anomaly of the curved plate of bone that is situated inferiorly to the squamous part and anteriorly to the mastoid part of the temporal bone; it surrounds the external auditory meatus, forming the anterior wall, floor and some of the posterior wall of the bony external acoustic meatus; its lateral border gives the attachment to the cartilaginous part of the external acoustic meatus; its anteroinferior surface forms the posterior boundary of the mandibular fossa")
