# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030330> (abnormal temporomandibular joint disk morphology)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://teachmeanatomy.info/head/joints/temporomandibular/") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://radiopaedia.org/articles/temporomandibular-joint-disc") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4147437/") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030330> "any structural anomaly of the oval, biconcave, avascular fibrocartilaginous structure located between the condyle of the mandible and the mandibular (glenoid) fossa of the temporal bone; the disk provides the gliding surface for the mandibular condyle, resulting in smooth joint movement; it splits the temporomandibular joint into two synovial joint cavities, each lined by a synovial membrane, and separates translational and rotational motion")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030330> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6490-7723>)
