# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030520> (oral mucosa blisters)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://books.google.com/books?isbn=0470673966") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://medical-dictionary.thefreedictionary.com/blisterform+oral+lesions") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0030520> "localized pockets of fluid that form within or beneath the oral mucosa; may appear as pustules, vesicles, or bullae; color varies according to content of blister, which may include blood, serum, mucin, or suppuration")
