AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GO:0005791") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0031685> "any structural anomaly of the form of the endoplasmic reticulum that has ribosomes adhering to its outer surface, giving it a rough appearance")
