AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0031713> "Bidirectional ventricular tachycardia is typically classified as a polymorphic ventricular tachycardia given that there is more than one QRS morphology, but sometimes it is defined as its own entity as a dual morphology ventricular tachycardia.")
