AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31836688") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41521804") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0031725> "any functional anomaly of the podosomes, actin-rich protrusions formed on the  membrane of several cell types, that act as adhesion sites between the actin skeleton and the extracellular matrix; they mediate numerous functions, including cell-matrix adhesion, extracellular matrix degradation, mechanosensing and cell migration")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000233> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0031725> <https://github.com/mgijax/mammalian-phenotype-ontology/issues/4238>)
